# Deny-all allowlist, same reasoning as the POC: the deploy uploads everything
# unless told otherwise, and .gitignore has no say in it.
/*
!/app
!/content
!/public
!/package.json
!/package-lock.json
!/tsconfig.json
!/next-env.d.ts
# The gate itself. Leaving it out of the allowlist silently ships an UNGATED site:
# the deploy succeeds, the build succeeds, and every page is public. Verified the hard way.
!/proxy.ts
